Steps I followed
1.Clicked on the dropdown menu at the top and selected the “Select other Board and Port” entry. In the search bar i typed esp32 and clicked the search icon.
2.Clicked on the AI thinker esp32 CAM and clicked the COM5 port.
3.Went to File > Examples > ESP32 > Camera > CameraWebServer.
4. Set the SSID in the code to "ESP32-CAM Access Point" and Paswword to "123456789"
5.i cleared this from the code "WiFi.begin(ssid, password);
while (WiFi.status() != WL_CONNECTED) {
  delay(500);
  Serial.print(".");
}
Serial.println("");
Serial.println("WiFi connected");"
6. And added "WiFi.softAP(ssid, password);" to set the ESP32 as an accesss point.
